{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Xk5Cc4jC124dWAPxANe53","type":"tool_result","content":"# DELETE /v1/models/{model_id} Endpoint\n\n## Purpose\nThis endpoint deletes a fine-tuned model from your account.\n\n## Required Parameter\nThe endpoint requires one parameter:\n\n**model_id** (string, required): \"The ID of the model to delete.\"\n\n## Response\nUpon successful deletion, the API returns a 200 status with:\n- `deleted`: boolean (true)\n- `id`: the model's ID\n- `object`: \"model\"\n\n## Example Usage\nUsing cURL:\n```\ncurl https://api.mistral.ai/v1/models/{model_id} \\\n -X DELETE \\\n -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_APIKEY_HERE' \\\n -H 'Content-Type: application/json'\n```\n\nThe endpoint supports TypeScript, Python, and cURL implementations."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc070dc6-ba02-43c5-a6da-e4c2a8dbe708","uuid":"f198760e-b874-44e2-842e-d4f3a10715d2","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:51:45.950Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1654201,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# DELETE /v1/models/{model_id} Endpoint\n\n## Purpose\nThis endpoint deletes a fine-tuned model from your account.\n\n## Required Parameter\nThe endpoint requires one parameter:\n\n**model_id** (string, required): \"The ID of the model to delete.\"\n\n## Response\nUpon successful deletion, the API returns a 200 status with:\n- `deleted`: boolean (true)\n- `id`: the model's ID\n- `object`: \"model\"\n\n## Example Usage\nUsing cURL:\n```\ncurl https://api.mistral.ai/v1/models/{model_id} \\\n -X DELETE \\\n -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_APIKEY_HERE' \\\n -H 'Content-Type: application/json'\n```\n\nThe endpoint supports TypeScript, Python, and cURL implementations.","durationMs":3133,"url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/models"}}
